FACT courts_prophet.the_diviners(learn_to_understand_not_to_do) = ("learn to understand, not to do (18:9) — the entry formula, the learning barred only 'to do' (the Sifrei 170:1-3; place_name's inquiry foreign_rite_inquiry_barred and seven_nations' abomination by CALL): THE WRITE abominations_learning_barred, a BLOCK on Israel at the chapters' own day; the sage who studies the sorcerers' ways to judge them accepted", ['abominations_learning_barred'])
