FACT refuge_war_family.the_landmark_and_the_witnesses(one_witness_for_any_iniquity) = ("one witness for any iniquity (19:15) — the general rule from the particular (I3): in capital cases, money, offerings and lashes one witness stands not; for an oath it obliges (the Sifrei 188:4-9; courts_prophet's two_witnesses_required and one_witness_barred, refuge's two_by_the_prototype and ordinances' merit_by_one_liability_by_two by CALL): THE WRITE two_or_three_witnesses_required, a STATUS on Israel at the chapters' own day; the creditor with one witness accepted for the oath alone", ['two_or_three_witnesses_required'])
