FACT refuge_war_family.the_priests_speech(the_fearful_and_the_faint_of_heart) = ("the fearful and the faint of heart (20:8) — as it sounds (R. Akiva), the sinner hidden among the others (R. Yose the Galilean), the forbidden unions' betrothed (R. Yose): three arms (the Sifrei 197:2-4; Mishnah Sotah 8:5): THE WRITE fearful_exemption_commanded, a STATUS on Israel at the chapters' own day; the soldier who cannot see a drawn sword accepted for the return", ['fearful_exemption_commanded'])
